      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Center Point earned its name by being the approximate center of Ward One in Avoyelles Parish, a fact highlighted on local markers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/center_point_louisiana",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Center Point’s surroundings are shaped by the nearby Atchafalaya River Basin, North America’s largest river swamp that affects flooding and wildlife.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
